WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Change an item’s price in Stock items, or confirm reviewed price updates from an invoice.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Step 2: The effective price also updates the latest non-deleted order containing that item at each compatible location in the company.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Step 3: Open Order history to see Stock prices updated, the original prices and the revised total.

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Step 4: Review ordering budgets and order reports using the revised values.
